{"content_text": "{\"protocolSection\":{\"identificationModule\":{\"nctId\":\"NCT01194804\",\"orgStudyIdInfo\":{\"id\":\"E07-001\"},\"organization\":{\"fullName\":\"Alexion Pharmaceuticals, Inc.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"},\"briefTitle\":\"E07-001: Safety and Efficacy Extension Study of Eculizumab in Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria Patients\",\"officialTitle\":\"Phase II Clinical Study of Eculizumab (h5G1.1-mAb) in Hemolytic Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria (PNH) Patients: Extension Study to C07-001 Protocol\"},\"statusModule\":{\"statusVerifiedDate\":\"2019-09\",\"overallStatus\":\"COMPLETED\",\"expandedAccessInfo\":{\"hasExpandedAccess\":false},\"startDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2008-04\"},\"primaryCompletionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2010-09\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"completionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2011-03\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"studyFirstSubmitDate\":\"2010-08-30\",\"studyFirstSubmitQcDate\":\"2010-09-02\",\"studyFirstPostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2010-09-03\",\"type\":\"ESTIMATED\"},\"resultsFirstSubmitDate\":\"2017-11-06\",\"resultsFirstSubmitQcDate\":\"2019-04-30\",\"resultsFirstPostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2019-07-12\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"lastUpdateSubmitDate\":\"2019-09-13\",\"lastUpdatePostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2019-09-17\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"sponsorCollaboratorsModule\":{\"responsibleParty\":{\"type\":\"SPONSOR\"},\"leadSponsor\":{\"name\":\"Alexion Pharmaceuticals, Inc.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"},\"collaborators\":[{\"name\":\"CMIC Co, Ltd. Japan\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"}]},\"oversightModule\":{\"oversightHasDmc\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDrug\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDevice\":false},\"descriptionModule\":{\"briefSummary\":\"The objective of this study was to assess the long-term safety and efficacy of eculizumab in hemolytic PNH patients who completed the 4-week screening and 12-week treatment period of the C07-001 study. In addition, pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic assessments of eculizumab were conducted.\"},\"conditionsModule\":{\"conditions\":[\"Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria\"],\"keywords\":[\"Hemolytic Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria\",\"Eculizumab\",\"PNH\"]},\"designModule\":{\"studyType\":\"INTERVENTIONAL\",\"phases\":[\"PHASE2\"],\"designInfo\":{\"allocation\":\"NA\",\"interventionModel\":\"SINGLE_GROUP\",\"primaryPurpose\":\"TREATMENT\",\"maskingInfo\":{\"masking\":\"NONE\"}},\"enrollmentInfo\":{\"count\":27,\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"armsInterventionsModule\":{\"armGroups\":[{\"label\":\"Eculizumab\",\"type\":\"EXPERIMENTAL\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with PNH who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Drug: Eculizumab\"]}],\"interventions\":[{\"type\":\"DRUG\",\"name\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Each vial contains 30 mL of 10 mg/mL eculizumab; dose of 900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\",\"armGroupLabels\":[\"Eculizumab\"],\"otherNames\":[\"Soliris\"]}]},\"outcomesModule\":{\"primaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Change From Baseline in Lactate Dehydrogenase\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\"}],\"secondaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Change From Baseline in FACIT-Fatigue Scale Total Score\",\"description\":\"The FACIT-Fatigue scale, Version 4.0, is a collection of quality of life questionnaires pertaining to the management of fatigue symptoms due to a chronic illness. The FACIT-Fatigue is a 13-item questionnaire that assesses self-reported fatigue and its impact upon daily activities and function over the preceding 7 days. Patients score each item on a 5-point scale: 0 (Not at all) to 4 (Very much). Total scores range from 0 to 52, with higher score indicating better quality of life.\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\"},{\"measure\":\"Change From Baseline in PNH Red Blood Cell (RBC) Count\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\"},{\"measure\":\"Change From Baseline in Number of Units of Packed RBCs Transfused\",\"description\":\"Baseline is defined as the number of units transfused in 3 months prior to baseline\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\"},{\"measure\":\"Change From Baseline in Plasma Free Hemoglobin\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\"}]},\"eligibilityModule\":{\"eligibilityCriteria\":\"Inclusion Criteria:\\n\\n* Patients must have fully completed C07-001 study 12-week treatment period\\n\\nExclusion Criteria:\\n\\n* Patients who terminated early from the C07-001 study\",\"healthyVolunteers\":false,\"sex\":\"ALL\",\"minimumAge\":\"12 Years\",\"stdAges\":[\"CHILD\",\"ADULT\",\"OLDER_ADULT\"]},\"referencesModule\":{\"references\":[{\"pmid\":\"23934275\",\"type\":\"RESULT\",\"citation\":\"Kanakura Y, Ohyashiki K, Shichishima T, Okamoto S, Ando K, Ninomiya H, Kawaguchi T, Nakao S, Nakakuma H, Nishimura J, Kinoshita T, Bedrosian CL, Ozawa K, Omine M. Long-term efficacy and safety of eculizumab in Japanese patients with PNH: AEGIS trial. Int J Hematol. 2013 Oct;98(4):406-16. doi: 10.1007/s12185-013-1404-y. Epub 2013 Aug 11.\"}]},\"ipdSharingStatementModule\":{\"ipdSharing\":\"NO\"}},\"resultsSection\":{\"participantFlowModule\":{\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"FG000\",\"title\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with paroxysmal nocturnal hemoglobinuria who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol (NCT01192399)\\n\\nEculizumab: 900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\"}],\"periods\":[{\"title\":\"Overall Study\",\"milestones\":[{\"type\":\"STARTED\",\"achievements\":[{\"groupId\":\"FG000\",\"numSubjects\":\"27\"}]},{\"type\":\"COMPLETED\",\"achievements\":[{\"groupId\":\"FG000\",\"numSubjects\":\"26\"}]},{\"type\":\"NOT COMPLETED\",\"achievements\":[{\"groupId\":\"FG000\",\"numSubjects\":\"1\"}]}],\"dropWithdraws\":[{\"type\":\"Withdrawal by Subject\",\"reasons\":[{\"groupId\":\"FG000\",\"numSubjects\":\"1\"}]}]}]},\"baselineCharacteristicsModule\":{\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"BG000\",\"title\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with PNH who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol\\n\\n900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"BG000\",\"value\":\"27\"}]}],\"measures\":[{\"title\":\"Age, Continuous\",\"paramType\":\"MEAN\",\"dispersionType\":\"STANDARD_DEVIATION\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"years\",\"classes\":[{\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"BG000\",\"value\":\"48.3\",\"spread\":\"12.35\"}]}]}]},{\"title\":\"Sex: Female, Male\",\"paramType\":\"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"Participants\",\"classes\":[{\"categories\":[{\"title\":\"Female\",\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"BG000\",\"value\":\"14\"}]},{\"title\":\"Male\",\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"BG000\",\"value\":\"13\"}]}]}]},{\"title\":\"Race/Ethnicity, Customized\",\"paramType\":\"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"Participants\",\"classes\":[{\"title\":\"Japanese\",\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"BG000\",\"value\":\"27\"}]}]}]},{\"title\":\"Region of Enrollment\",\"paramType\":\"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"Participants\",\"classes\":[{\"title\":\"Japan\",\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"BG000\",\"value\":\"27\"}]}]}]}]},\"outcomeMeasuresModule\":{\"outcomeMeasures\":[{\"type\":\"PRIMARY\",\"title\":\"Change From Baseline in Lactate Dehydrogenase\",\"reportingStatus\":\"POSTED\",\"paramType\":\"MEAN\",\"dispersionType\":\"Standard Error\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"Units/Liter\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\",\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"OG000\",\"title\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with PNH who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol\\n\\n900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"26\"}]}],\"classes\":[{\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"-15.9\",\"spread\":\"1.20\"}]}]}],\"analyses\":[{\"groupIds\":[\"OG000\"],\"nonInferiorityType\":\"OTHER\",\"pValue\":\"<0.001\",\"statisticalMethod\":\"Sign test\"}]},{\"type\":\"SECONDARY\",\"title\":\"Change From Baseline in FACIT-Fatigue Scale Total Score\",\"description\":\"The FACIT-Fatigue scale, Version 4.0, is a collection of quality of life questionnaires pertaining to the management of fatigue symptoms due to a chronic illness. The FACIT-Fatigue is a 13-item questionnaire that assesses self-reported fatigue and its impact upon daily activities and function over the preceding 7 days. Patients score each item on a 5-point scale: 0 (Not at all) to 4 (Very much). Total scores range from 0 to 52, with higher score indicating better quality of life.\",\"reportingStatus\":\"POSTED\",\"paramType\":\"MEAN\",\"dispersionType\":\"Standard Error\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"units on a scale\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\",\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"OG000\",\"title\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with PNH who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol\\n\\n900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"26\"}]}],\"classes\":[{\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"8.0\",\"spread\":\"1.95\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"SECONDARY\",\"title\":\"Change From Baseline in PNH Red Blood Cell (RBC) Count\",\"reportingStatus\":\"POSTED\",\"paramType\":\"MEAN\",\"dispersionType\":\"Standard Error\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"cellsx10^12/L\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\",\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"OG000\",\"title\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with PNH who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol\\n\\n900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"26\"}]}],\"classes\":[{\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"0.51\",\"spread\":\"0.129\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"SECONDARY\",\"title\":\"Change From Baseline in Number of Units of Packed RBCs Transfused\",\"description\":\"Baseline is defined as the number of units transfused in 3 months prior to baseline\",\"reportingStatus\":\"POSTED\",\"paramType\":\"MEAN\",\"dispersionType\":\"Standard Error\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"units\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\",\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"OG000\",\"title\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with PNH who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol\\n\\n900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"26\"}]}],\"classes\":[{\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"-3.5\",\"spread\":\"1.43\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"SECONDARY\",\"title\":\"Change From Baseline in Plasma Free Hemoglobin\",\"reportingStatus\":\"POSTED\",\"paramType\":\"MEAN\",\"dispersionType\":\"Standard Error\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"mg/dL\",\"timeFrame\":\"52 weeks (includes 12 weeks of eculizumab treatment in the parent study and 40 weeks in the extension study)\",\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"OG000\",\"title\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with PNH who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol\\n\\n900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"26\"}]}],\"classes\":[{\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"-13.5\",\"spread\":\"8.55\"}]}]}]}]},\"adverseEventsModule\":{\"frequencyThreshold\":\"5\",\"timeFrame\":\"From baseline (after first dose) to end of study (1 year).\",\"eventGroups\":[{\"id\":\"EG000\",\"title\":\"Eculizumab\",\"description\":\"Treatment with eculizumab for patients with PNH who have successfully completed the C07-001 protocol\\n\\n900 mg intravenous every 14 days.\",\"deathsNumAffected\":0,\"deathsNumAtRisk\":27,\"seriousNumAffected\":12,\"seriousNumAtRisk\":27,\"otherNumAffected\":26,\"otherNumAtRisk\":27}],\"seriousEvents\":[{\"term\":\"Anaemia\",\"organSystem\":\"Blood and lymphatic system disorders\",\"assessmentType\":\"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numAffected\":2,\"numAtRisk\":27}]},{\"term\":\"Haemolysis\",\"organSystem\":\"Blood and lymphatic system disorders\",\"assessmentType\":\"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":27}]},{\"term\":\"Colitis\",\"organSystem\":\"Gastrointestinal disorders\",\"assessmentType\":\"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":27}]},{\"term\":\"Pyrexia\",\"organSystem\":\"General disorders\",\"assessmentType\":\"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numAffected\":2,\"numAtRisk\":27}]},{\"term\":\"Cholelithiasis\",\"organSystem\":\"Hepatobiliary disorders\",\"assessmentType\":\"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":27}]},{\"term\":\"Jaundice cholestatic\",\"organSystem\":\"Hepatobiliary disorders\",\"assessmentType\":\"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":27}]},{\"term\":\"Pneumonia\",\"organSystem\":\"Infectio